  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Stonewall SAFAR Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The data relates to the Stonewall project SAFAR: building global capacity for secure LGBTQ+ refugee protection, humanitarian response &amp; community hubs in crises. 
Main aims of the project: To use the understanding gained through supporting LGBTQ+ people in Afghanistan to provide an evidence-based framework to support LGBTQ+ people in high-risk refugee protection and humanitarian situations; build capacity of internally displaced LGBTQ+ communities through hubs; and build capacity of humanitarian actors to meet the diverse needs of crisis-affected LGBTQ+ people globally.  

The project is funded through FCDO</narrative>
  </description>
